<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH CNB-120 INDEX RISES 1.9 POINTS TO 839.7 PTS.</title>
<headline>CZECH CNB-120 INDEX RISES 1.9 POINTS TO 839.7 PTS.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, rose 1.9 points on Friday to 839.7, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Four of the ten sectoral indices gained, with the investment fund index rising the most, up 21.4 points to 1,383.3.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
